# Don't track the contents of the archived shadow directories.
# They exist on disk for audit-trail purposes only. The README
# one directory up describes what's here; the individual files
# (htslib binaries, broken symlinks, conda caches, hyprcoloc_src
# git checkout) add no value to the git history.
#
# If anything in here turns out to matter later, copy it out of
# the archive before tracking it.
*
!.gitignore
